# Non-Functional Requirements

- No stale connection status shall be displayed.
- No Kubernetes cookie shall be persisted outside the active backend session.
- Connection status shall always be backend-driven.
- Session cleanup shall occur automatically upon authentication failure.
- All Kubernetes environments shall behave consistently.
- Backend must remain the single source of truth for connection state.

